		{
			dependencies: ["2E66DFDA5014FCD7"]
			description: [
				"The &5Entropy Cradle&r is a massive &cenergy accumulator&r and &etransmutation multiblock&r."
				""
				"It can store up to &a300,000,000 AE&r, which is &a600,000,000 FE&r, and converts entire structures into &5extremely powerful blocks&r once fully charged."
				""
				"• The Entropy Cradle charges using &3AE2&r energy only"
				"• Charging stops automatically at &a300M AE&r"
				""
				"During charging:"
				"• &eSix capacitor layers&r light up progressively"
				"• Capacitors emit a &credstone comparator signal&r when the Cradle is &afully charged&r"
				""
				"Once the Cradle is &afully charged&r:"
				"• Apply a &credstone pulse&r to the controller"
				"• The Cradle &cdischarges&r completely"
				"• If a &eknown recipe structure&r is inside, it will be &atransmuted&r into a powerful block"
				""
				"Examples include:"
				"• &dPenrose Frame&r"
				"• &eEnergy Storage Components&r"
				"• &5Infinity 9 Block&r"
				""
				"• All available transmutation recipes can be found in &eJEI&r"
				"• The Entropy Cradle can be &afully automated&r using the &dAuto Builder&r"
				""
				"• Requires a valid &3AE2&r network with channels"
				"• Can &cONLY&r be charged using &3AE2&r energy"
				"• Full charge is required — partial charge does &cNOT&r work"
				""
				"It is recommended to seperate it from main networks with quartz fiber."
				"This will save 1 channel, and also prevents &3Crafting Storages&r in recipe structure from being assigned."
			]
			icon: "crazyae2addons:entropy_cradle_controller"
			id: "553EF8386D321C37"
			min_width: 300
			rewards: [{
